    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>description_short</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"415 characters\">The Earth was formed about 4.6 billion years ago, that&#039;s 4,600,000,000 years ago. It was formed by collisions of particles in a large cloud of material. Slowly gravity gathered together all these particles of dust and gas and formed larger clumps. These clumps continued to collide and gradually grew bigger and bigger eventually forming the Earth. The earth at this time was very different to how we know it today.</span>\"
